        "Unit 1: AI capabilities and useful tasks \u2014 What will you carry forward?",
        "Unit 10: Bring the solution into use \u2014 Support the first real task",
        "Unit 8: Evaluate impact and resources \u2014 Connect a measured task result to a realistic impact estimate"
